  "note_rig": "Rig on the model's own hinges (geo px = source x 0.68657 + [0, 6.866, z offset]): the one trailing-edge surface a side (parts 10/11) as aileron/flaperon +-25 deg; all-moving stabilators (the flat plates of part 2) on a lateral spindle at mid chord, +-25 deg, 0.3 roll; canted twin rudders (part 7) on their forward-raked hinge lines, +-30 deg; twin nose wheel rotors and one main wheel rotor a side at the model's own centres. No thrust-vectoring nozzle bones (the FC-31 has round fixed nozzles). No leading-edge flaps: the wing is not split there.",
